> The `issuer-uri` approach auto-discovers the JWKS endpoint. As shown in typical configs: `spring.security.oauth2.resourceserver.jwt.issuer-uri` and `jwk-set-uri` values are derived from the realm's OpenID configuration. Using `issuer-uri` alone is preferred because it lets Spring fetch and rotate signing keys automatically.

